# Source code is NOT published in this repository (closed-source).
# These paths guard against accidentally committing the extension source.

extension/
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Release distribution artifacts ARE published on purpose: the in-app update
# check reads release/LATEST.json + the version zip from this repo through
# jsDelivr / raw.githubusercontent, so they must be committed.
# (The unpacked staging folders inside release/ stay ignored.)
release/*
!release/LATEST.json
!release/tomi-browser-extension-*.zip
!release/RELEASE_NOTES-*.md
# Internal design docs & prototypes — keep them OUT of the public repo.
# (README.md / PRIVACY.md / LICENSE are intentional and stay tracked.)
mockup/
ADS.md
DESIGN.md
UI-DESIGN.md